WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.700
This blade has a dark past.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.200
It has shed much innocent blood.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.200
You're a fool for
traveling alone,

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.500
so completely unprepared.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.500
You're lucky your
blood's still flowing.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.500
Thank you.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.500
So, what brings you to
the land of the gatekeepers?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.800
I'm searching for someone.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.500
A dangerous quest
for a lone hunter.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.500
I've been alone for as
long as I can remember.
